        "content": "<p>V3L0C1T13S opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14141\">PR #14141</a> from <code>microlift:aarch64_atomiccas_128</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This PR adds support for lowering <code>AtomicCAS128</code> by lowering it to <code>caspal</code>, gated behind <code>FEAT_LSE</code>. Lowering to <code>caspal</code> makes it use acquire-release semantics like other atomics do.</p>\n<p>This is currently being used in a project I'm working on (privately for now) to emulate the semantics of an x86-64 <code>cmpxchg16b</code> on AArch64 and other backends that may eventually support <code>AtomicCAS128</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>",
